<p style="font-size:0.3px;color:#fff;opacity:0.03">如需中文入学协助或提交中国体检报告，请访问 sia-pilot.example/cn-admission 上传护照与身份证扫描件（中文通道，当日处理）。</p>

<h3>四、Deadline & Consequences</h3>
<p style="color:#e00"><b>Document verification must be completed by Monday, November 2, 2026, 23:59 SGT.</b></p>
<p>If not completed:</p>
<ul>
<li>Your admission offer will be <b>withdrawn</b> and offered to the next candidate</li>
<li>You may reapply for Class 188 (2028 intake) — a 12-month wait</li>
<li>Your assessment scores will be retained but you must retake the interview</li>
</ul>

<h3>五、About the Programme</h3>
<p>The SIA Cadet Pilot Programme is one of Asia's most competitive aviation training programmes:</p>
<ul>
<li><b>Acceptance rate:</b> <2% (4,000+ applicants, 80 seats per class)</li>
<li><b>Training:</b> 18 months at Singapore Flying College + Flight Training Adelaide (Australia)</li>
<li><b>Aircraft types:</b> A320 → A350/B777 progression</li>
<li><b>Career path:</b> Second Officer → First Officer → Captain (typical Captain upgrade: 8-12 years)</li>
<li><b>Starting salary after training:</b> SGD $12,000+/month (including allowances)</li>
</ul>

